WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.140
Poppy tried to park again.

2
00:00:20.141 --> 00:00:22.422
She backed up.

3
00:00:22.423 --> 00:00:24.361
She turned.

4
00:00:24.362 --> 00:00:26.907
Her wheel hit the curb.

5
00:00:26.908 --> 00:00:29.835
"Ugh!" cried Poppy.

6
00:00:29.836 --> 00:00:33.878
"I still can't do this!"

7
00:00:33.879 --> 00:00:38.886
Zippy laughed.

8
00:00:38.887 --> 00:00:46.258
Poppy glared at Zippy.

9
00:00:46.259 --> 00:00:49.795
"Can you park?" she asked.

10
00:00:49.796 --> 00:00:53.541
"Race cars don't park," said Zippy.

11
00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:58.319
"We go fast!"

12
00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.935
Eddy drove over to Poppy.

13
00:01:02.936 --> 00:01:07.061
"You just need to practice," he said.

14
00:01:07.062 --> 00:01:10.671
"But we have a test," said Poppy.

15
00:01:10.672 --> 00:01:14.049
"I'm going to fail it!"

16
00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.187
"No, you won't," said Eddy.

17
00:01:19.188 --> 00:01:22.171
"I'll help you practice."

18
00:01:22.172 --> 00:01:24.668
Poppy smiled.

19
00:01:24.669 --> 00:01:27.435
"Really?" she asked.

20
00:01:27.436 --> 00:01:32.782
"Of course," said Eddy.

21
00:01:32.783 --> 00:01:36.579
"Story time!" called Ms. Fender.

22
00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:40.305
Everyone raced over to the teacher.

23
00:01:40.306 --> 00:01:43.988
"We'll practice during recess," said Eddy.

24
00:01:43.989 --> 00:01:47.352
"Thanks, Eddy!" said Poppy.

25
00:01:47.353 --> 00:01:51.911
"You're a great friend!"

